{"id":"W95cd3a4a792dbd6f0e9ab2b0","zh":"时-频能量联合分布","en":"","name":"时-频能量联合分布","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"Ca27e44481c22e79f180a","families":[],"definition_zh":"同时描述信号能量随时间和频率变化的分布。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于联合表示轨道不平顺的线路位置、频率与能量强弱，将频率成分及其能量分布对应到沿线位置，呈现不平顺能量在位置与频率上的分布。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W95cd3a4a792dbd6f0e9ab2b0","text":"时-频能量联合分布","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S08ef0b9852383577b496","source_id":"P110","page":4,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"图2 轨道高低不平顺原始信号的EMD分解 (3)根据实际,选取需要分析的本征模态函数,计算其SPWVD,获取时-频能量联合分布,如图3所示; 或汇总所有或某几阶本征模态函数的时-频能量联合分布,如图4所示。","citations":[{"source_id":"P110","page":4,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"Sd3a555fd0dd6cfbb3147","source_id":"P110","page":5,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"为表明本文提出的时-频能量联合分析方法能较好融合轨道谱状态表征及特征波长统计等方面的性能,也为了验证式(10)的正确性,以前三阶本征模态函数为例,计算本征模态函数功率谱密度和时-频能量联合分布在频域的平均能量密度分布,如图6所示。","citations":[{"source_id":"P110","page":5,"page_end":6}]}],"sources":{"P110":{"id":"P110","title":"铁路轨道不平顺的时-频能量联合分析方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2017","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2017.04.002","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-time-frequency-energy-joint-analysis-method-for-railway-track-irregularity"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"将位置、频率和能量强弱联系起来的联合表示。","language":"zh","source_id":"P110","paper_slug":"2017-time-frequency-energy-joint-analysis-method-for-railway-track-irregularity","title":"铁路轨道不平顺的时-频能量联合分析方法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W40454054482c0542b7e6e0d2","name":"time-frequency energy joint distribution","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W40454054482c0542b7e6e0d2","name":"time-frequency energy joint distribution","language":"en","kind":"translat